  "bio": "Allied Ink, nestled in the vibrant heart of Marietta, offers a diverse spectrum of illustrative tattoo artistry, brought to life by the talented hands of artists like @hellyeahtattooing and @takahashi404. Embrace a welcoming, creatively charged atmosphere where walk-ins are celebrated, though appointments are recommended to secure your ink session—a commitment initiated with a required deposit.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Marietta, Georgia, United States"
